our,\" unless specified otherwise) was formed as a Delaware corporation in 2015, and prior to that, the first CAVA restaurant opened in 2011 in Bethesda, Maryland. As of December 28, 2025, we operate 439 fast-casual CAVA Restaurants in 28 states and Washington, D.C. The Company's authentic Mediterranean cuisine unites taste and health, with a menu that features chef-curated and customizable bowls and pitas. We centrally produce our dips, spreads, and certain dressing bases for use in our restaurants while also selling our dips, spreads, and prepared dressings in grocery stores.","zh":"CAVA Group, Inc.（連同其全資子公司，統稱為“公司”、“CAVA”、“我們”、“我們的”和“我們的”，除非另有說明）於 2015 年作為一家特拉華州公司成立，在此之前，第一家 CAVA 餐廳於 2011 年在馬裡蘭州貝塞斯達開業。截至 2025 年 12 月 28 日，我們在 28 個州和華盛頓特區經營 439 家休閒快餐 CAVA 餐廳。該公司的正宗地中海美食將口味與健康融為一體，菜單包括廚師精心策劃和可定制的碗和皮塔餅。我們集中生產餐廳使用的沾醬、塗抹醬和某些調味品底料，同時也在雜貨店銷售我們的沾醬、塗抹醬和預製調味品。"},{"en":"We believe that our differentiated offerings and broad appeal give us significant opportunity in the Mediterranean and health and wellness food categories. Our guests span age groups, genders, and income brackets with a strong Millennial and a growing Gen Z contingent. The broad appeal of our brand is evidenced by substantial diversity across geographies, formats, dayparts, and channels. We are in the early stages of fulfilling our total restaurant potential, and we believe there is opportunity for more than 1,000 CAVA restaurants in the United States by 2032. We believe we are well positioned to benefit from the following strong and emerging trends:","zh":"我們相信，我們的差異化產品和廣泛的吸引力為我們在地中海和保健食品類別中帶來了巨大的機會。我們的賓客跨越年齡層、性別和收入階層，其中包括強大的千禧世代和不斷成長的 Z 世代。我們品牌的廣泛吸引力體現在跨地域、形式、時段和通路的巨大多樣性。我們正處於實現餐廳總潛力的早期階段，我們相信到 2032 年，美國將有超過 1,000 家 CAVA 餐廳的機會。我們相信，我們處於有利位置，可以從以下強勁的新興趨勢中受益："},{"en":"Our menu fulfills a broad range of dietary preferences, from hearty and indulgent to vegan, vegetarian, gluten-free, dairy-free, paleo, keto, and nut-free diets. We have designed our menu to offer vibrant flavors using many fresh, high-","zh":"我們的菜單滿足廣泛的飲食偏好，從豐盛和放縱的飲食到純素食、素食、無麩質、無乳製品、原始人飲食、酮飲食和無堅果飲食。我們設計的菜單旨在提供充滿活力的風味，使用許多新鮮、高品質的原料。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The restaurant industry is highly competitive with respect to, among other things, food quality and presentation, taste preferences, price, brand reputation, digital engagement, service, value, and location. The food manufacturing industry is also highly competitive with respect to, among other things, food quality, taste, functional benefits, nutritional value and ingredients, convenience, brand loyalty and positioning, food variety, product packaging, shelf space, price, and promotional activities. We face significant competition from national, regional, and locally-owned restaurants, including limited service restaurants, particularly within the fast-casual dining and traditional fast-food categories, which offer in-restaurant, carry-out, delivery, and/or catering services. We also compete with grocery stores, meal subscription services, and delivery kitchens, especially those that ta","zh":"餐飲業在食品品質和外觀、口味偏好、價格、品牌聲譽、數位參與、服務、價值和位置等方面競爭激烈。食品製造業在食品品質、口味、功能優勢、營養價值和成分、便利性、品牌忠誠度和定位、食品品種、產品包裝、貨架空間、價格和促銷活動等方面也競爭激烈。我們面臨來自國家、地區和當地餐廳的激烈競爭，包括有限服務餐廳，特別是在快餐休閒餐飲和傳統快餐類別中，這些餐廳提供餐廳內、外帶、外送和/或餐飲服務。我們也與雜貨店、訂餐服務和送貨廚房競爭，尤其是那些需要提供服務的商店。"},{"en":"As we expand our geographic presence and develop our digital channels, we anticipate we will face increased competition for channel access. In addition, our competitors will likely grow in number as the Mediterranean food category grows, and we may face the risk that new or existing competitors will mimic our business model, menu offerings, marketing strategies, and overall concept. See Item 1A. \"Risk Factors—Risks Related to Our Business and Our Industry—We operate in a highly competitive industry\" for more information.","zh":"隨著我們擴大地域影響力並開發數位管道，我們預計我們將面臨日益激烈的通路競爭。此外，隨著地中海食品類別的成長，我們的競爭對手的數量可能會增加，我們可能面臨新的或現有的競爭對手模仿我們的商業模式、菜單產品、行銷策略和整體概念的風險。請參閱第 1A 項。 「風險因素——與我們的業務和行業相關的風險——我們在一個競爭激烈的行業中運營」以了解更多資訊。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-28","items":[{"name":"Restaurant Revenue","val":1169286000,"zh":"餐廳收入"},{"name":"CPG Revenue & Other","val":10378000,"zh":"消費品收入及其他"}],"total":1179664000}},"peers":["SG","BROS","RDDT","CELH","TOST"]}}